      "statusChangeID": "6436154feaf18709e354ed71",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This sounds like an issue that we are already aware of and fixed in the current open beta. It should only affect some specific worlds that require the use of custom network IDs, such as VirtualFurence, where portions of the world do not exist on quest for file size and performance limits.\n\nThis is now fixed in the open beta, where it respects custom network IDs.\n\nIn the future, please provide all relevant information such as the world where this occurred.",
